WEBVTT

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.400
Meet Leia’s Learning Adventures:

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.210
Kindergarten,

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.070
where learning feels like play.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.720
Trace every letter with numbered start

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:11.880
dots and arrows that show where

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:13.360
each stroke begins.

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:14.410
Count the pictures,

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:15.750
fill the ten frame,

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:18.000
and color one star for every

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:18.460
number.

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:20.440
Then solve mazes and puzzles that

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:21.450
check themselves,

00:00:21.550 --> 00:00:23.500
because only the right path reaches

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:24.200
the finish.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:25.200
Seven lands,

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.140
three friends,

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:28.380
and one very good dog are

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:29.700
ready to guide your child.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.180
Every page has a short tip

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:32.090
for grown-ups.

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:33.260
There is an answer key at

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:35.260
the back and a certificate to

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:36.070
celebrate.

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:37.880
A hundred and ten printable pages

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.510
for ages four to six.

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:42.510
Instant download in Letter and A4

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:45.030
from LogicManse Publications.
